    "turn_idx": 91,
    "turn_text": "when you look at that symbolism and heartbreaking really when you look at what is happening to our country here right now on so many levels. When they lump, they intentionally lump many different pieces of legislation or issues together in one bill to try to force people's hands in casting a vote for something where they may like one thing, but they don't like five things. But the one thing is really",
